  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    R = len(grid)\n    C = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find the top-left corner of the 2x2 block of 3s\n    r_3, c_3 = -1, -1\n    for i in range(R):\n        for j in range(C):\n            if grid[i][j] == 3:\n                r_3 = i\n                c_3 = j\n                break\n        if r_3 != -1:\n            break\n            \n    # Create a copy of the grid to store the output\n    out_grid = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Reflect all '2's across the vertical, horizontal, and both axes\n    if r_3 != -1:\n        for i in range(R):\n            for j in range(C):\n                if grid[i][j] == 2:\n                    i_sym = 2 * r_3 + 1 - i\n                    j_sym = 2 * c_3 + 1 - j\n                    \n                    for ni, nj in [(i, j), (i, j_sym), (i_sym, j), (i_sym, j_sym)]:\n                        if 0 <= ni < R and 0 <= nj < C:\n                            out_grid[ni][nj] = 2\n                            \n    return out_grid\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    R = len(grid)\n    C = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find the top-left corner of the 2x2 block of 3s\n    r_3, c_3 = -1, -1\n    for i in range(R):\n        for j in range(C):\n            if grid[i][j] == 3:\n                r_3 = i\n                c_3 = j\n                break\n        if r_3 != -1:\n            break\n            \n    # Create a copy of the grid to store the output\n    out_grid = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    # Reflect all '2's across the vertical, horizontal, and both axes\n    if r_3 != -1:\n        for i in range(R):\n            for j in range(C):\n                if grid[i][j] == 2:\n                    i_sym = 2 * r_3 + 1 - i\n                    j_sym = 2 * c_3 + 1 - j\n                    \n                    for ni, nj in [(i, j), (i, j_sym), (i_sym, j), (i_sym, j_sym)]:\n                        if 0 <= ni < R and 0 <= nj < C:\n                            out_grid[ni][nj] = 2\n                            \n    return out_grid",
